  "id": "henryspatialanalysis/openpois",
  "title": "OpenPOIs",
  "description": "OpenPOIs is a unified dataset of over 4.5 million points of interest across the United States, produced by conflating OpenStreetMap and Overture Maps sources. Each POI carries model-estimated confidence scores, harmonized category labels, and source-level diagnostics linking back to OSM and Overture identifiers. Data are distributed as hive-partitioned Parquet files and PMTiles archives, versioned by release date.",
